  <description>
    <p>This is a community package of PhotonCAM, maintained independently and unaffiliated with Niko Pietinen. It repackages the official upstream Linux build unmodified.</p>
    <p>PhotonCAM is a laser cutting and engraving CAM. It opens LightBurn projects and SVG files, writes GRBL G-code and Ruida programs, and can talk to a controller over USB serial. A web remote can show the job on another device on the same network.</p>
    <p>Sandbox: display, GPU, network for the web remote, USB serial for the laser controller, and the Documents folder so a project path keeps working. Open and Save otherwise go through the file chooser. The package does not send a job to a machine by itself.</p>
    <p>To open a project by path outside Documents, run <code>flatpak override --user --filesystem=home io.github.pietini69.photoncam</code>.</p>
  </description>
